    <description>Record-triggered Omni-Channel routing flow. Fires on VoiceCall insert and calls the standard routeWork invocable action to create a PendingServiceRouting for the new VoiceCall, handing it to Omni-Channel for distribution to an available agent monitoring the target Voice queue. The org-specific IDs (serviceChannelId, queueId, routingConfigId) are tokenized and resolved by DeveloperName at deploy time so the asset is portable across orgs. Deployed by service-omni-routing-flow-deploy. This is the production routing variant; Omni_Route_VoiceCalls is the autolaunched dryRun smoke-test variant that proves headless CLI invocability.</description>
